{"id":"n79431-2-9","stage":5,"title":"왕래 · 往来","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n79431-2-9-1","ko":"이웃과 왕래도 좀 하고 그러니?","zh":"你和邻居平时有些来往吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이웃과","meaning":"邻居，邻里","explanation":"이웃：邻居，邻里；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"이웃","audio":"/audio/56a0fd1527d122372c76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31487","senseId":"2","lemma":"이웃","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왕래도","meaning":"往来","explanation":"왕래：往来；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"왕래","audio":"/audio/fb69b171be99548de74f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79431","senseId":"2","lemma":"왕래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하고","meaning":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","explanation":"하다：表示两个以上的并列或反复。；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"26","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그러니?","meaning":"那样子","explanation":"그러다：那样子；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"그러다","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37062","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"56a0fd1527d12237","term":"이웃","zh":"邻居，邻里","audio":"/audio/56a0fd1527d122372c76.mp3","entryId":"31487","definition":"与自己的家邻近的家；或居住在那个房子里的人。","pronunciation":["이욷"]},{"id":"fb69b171be99548d","term":"왕래","zh":"往来","audio":"/audio/fb69b171be99548de74f.mp3","entryId":"79431","definition":"相互来来回回，交往密切。","pronunciation":["왕ː내"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"5cc953af09d8c68c","term":"그러다","zh":"那样子","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3","entryId":"37062","definition":"像前面发生过的事或说过的话一样地做。","pronunciation":["그러다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f927afcbcd99be69d82e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n79431-2-9-2","ko":"아니, 이곳으로 이사 온 후로 아직 이웃집 사람을 만나 보지도 못했는걸.","zh":"没有，搬来之后我还没见过邻居呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니,","meaning":"不，没","explanation":"아니：不，没","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65980","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이곳으로","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"이곳：这里，这儿；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"이곳","audio":"/audio/f7b06733762a4646c18b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71130","senseId":"1","lemma":"이곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이사","meaning":"搬家","explanation":"이사：搬家","readings":[{"term":"이사","audio":"/audio/925efb171a8616ccc70a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71138","senseId":"1","lemma":"이사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"온","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"후로","meaning":"后，以后，之后","explanation":"후：后，以后，之后；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"후","audio":"/audio/084a4bd8972f8d494487.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62885","senseId":"1","lemma":"후","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이웃집","meaning":"邻居，邻里","explanation":"이웃집：邻居，邻里","readings":[{"term":"이웃집","audio":"/audio/f78af582eb345e601f00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69532","senseId":"1","lemma":"이웃집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람을","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만나","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보지도","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못했는걸.","meaning":"没能","explanation":"못하다：没能；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는걸：表示新发现、感叹或与对方预期不同的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26838","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bcf26f704fdac00f","term":"아니","zh":"不，没","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3","entryId":"65980","definition":"用于表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["아니"]},{"id":"f7b06733762a4646","term":"이곳","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/f7b06733762a4646c18b.mp3","entryId":"71130","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["이곧"]},{"id":"925efb171a8616cc","term":"이사","zh":"搬家","audio":"/audio/925efb171a8616ccc70a.mp3","entryId":"71138","definition":"离开原先生活的地方，搬去别的地方。","pronunciation":["이사"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"084a4bd8972f8d49","term":"후","zh":"后，以后，之后","audio":"/audio/084a4bd8972f8d494487.mp3","entryId":"62885","definition":"一定时间过去以后。","pronunciation":["후ː"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"f78af582eb345e60","term":"이웃집","zh":"邻居，邻里","audio":"/audio/f78af582eb345e601f00.mp3","entryId":"69532","definition":"住得很近或挨着的房子。","pronunciation":["이욷찝"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"见面，相逢","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"其中一人来或去，二人因而相见。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term":"못하다","zh":"没能","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3","entryId":"26838","definition":"表示之前的话所指的行动未能达成或没有做该事的能力。","pronunciation":["모ː타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ee62f71ed4f973d91e7d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.585,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=79431","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":174,"sequenceScore":3.4117,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["没有，搬来之后我还没见过邻居呢。","你和邻居平时有些来往吗？","智秀家好像很有钱吧。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你和邻居平时有些来往吗？","智秀家好像很有钱吧。","没有，搬来之后我还没见过邻居呢。"],"answer":2}]}
